4... Nxd4 { Taking the Knight is a mistake, allowing the Queen to develop with no immediate threats. } 5. Qxd4 Qf6 (5... d6 { We'll simply develop and castle long. } 6. Nc3 Nf6 7. Bf4 Be7 8. O-O-O O-O) (5... c5 { It’s a useless attack; we simply move the Queen to safety. } 6. Qe3) (5... Nf6 { Developing the Knight naturally is met with direct attacks. } 6. e5) 6. e5 Qb6 7. Qxb6 axb6 { We now just want to develop the Knight and Bishop, then castle long. } { [%cal Gb1c3,Gc1f4] } *


